# Research

The reasoning behind {{projectName}}: what we're building, for whom, and why the architecture is what it is. Written before the build and updated when a decision changes it. Specs cite it; ADRs record the decisions it leads to.

## Reading order

1. `RESEARCH_MVP.md`: the product, its users, the MVP's scope and what's left out (to write).
2. `RESEARCH_STACK.md`: the stack and why, starting from [ADR 0002](../decisions/0002-the-starting-stack.md) (to write).

Add each `RESEARCH_*.md` here, in the order a newcomer should read it. Raw evidence (interviews, competitor notes, measurements) can live in `raw/NN-<slug>.md`, cited by the research docs.
